2026-07-27T08:14:40.3068501Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:14:40.3069141Z i /tmp/RtmpjCDkwt/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:14:40.3069888Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:14:40.3070426Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:14:40.3071141Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:14:40.3071856Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:14:40.3072867Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:14:40.3073641Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:14:40.3317417Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:14:40.3428348Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:14:40.3865565Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:14:40.4019992Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
